WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:06.530
El registro del capitán, Stardate 53556.4.

2
00:00:06.606 --> 00:00:08.574
Hemos sacado un barco dañado a bordo

3
00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:09.869
